      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: the scene bw_corrupted_vale needs one native load with this roster. The fork's scene layout, not a captured one; local kinds take ids 13052*100+n; knockouts, score, coins and the level gate are the fork fights' (fights/14xxx.json); job XP is the battles' 50."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) 1 later group(s) of the fork come as waves at their own spots: the first when the guards are down, each next one when the one before is down or 16 s after it (the captured Frostfang battle's gap)."
